---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms | Access Free Tools"
  description="Read the Access Free Tools terms for using free calculators, browser utilities, guides, ads, affiliate links, and third-party resources."
  path="/terms/"
>
  <section class="page-intro">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Terms</p>
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p>Use Access Free Tools responsibly and verify important results before relying on them.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section content-section-narrow legal-copy">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> April 30, 2026</p>

    <h2>General use</h2>
    <p>
      Access Free Tools provides calculators, converters, generators, and guides for general
      informational and everyday use. By using the site, you agree to use the tools responsibly and
      to verify important results before relying on them.
    </p>

    <h2>No professional advice</h2>
    <p>
      The utilities and guides are not professional financial, medical, legal, tax, engineering,
      security, or clinical advice. Finance, health, pregnancy, tax, construction, security, and
      similar tools are planning aids only. For important decisions, check the result with a
      qualified professional or official source.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy</h2>
    <p>
      We aim to make tools accurate and useful, but you should double-check important calculations
      before making decisions. Formulas, defaults, tax assumptions, medical estimates, market data,
      unit conversions, and third-party references can change or may not match your exact situation.
    </p>

    <h2>Random tools</h2>
    <p>
      Random number tools are provided for ordinary everyday use, examples, and simple choices.
      They should not be used for passwords, gambling, legal drawings, security decisions, or any
      high-stakes process that requires audited randomness.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising and affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Access Free Tools may show advertising, including Google AdSense, and may include affiliate
      links in blog guides or product callouts. If you click an affiliate link and buy something, we
      may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Affiliate links and ads do not change the tool
      formulas, and you do not need to buy anything to use the free tools.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party products and links</h2>
    <p>
      Ads, affiliate links, product previews, source references, and outbound links may lead to
      third-party websites. We are not responsible for third-party prices, shipping, product
      quality, availability, privacy practices, terms, or customer support.
    </p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The Access Free Tools name, page designs, written content, examples, icons, and code are
      protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may use the tools and copy your own
      results for personal, school, or business tasks, but you may not copy the site at scale,
      republish our pages as your own, or use automated scraping in a way that harms the service.
    </p>

    <h2>Feedback</h2>
    <p>
      If you send feedback, corrections, or tool ideas, you allow us to use that feedback to improve
      Access Free Tools without owing compensation. Do not send confidential or sensitive
      information through ordinary feedback messages.
    </p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Your use of the site is also covered by our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>,
      including sections about browser-first tools, cookies, advertising, and affiliate links.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update these terms as the site grows. The updated terms will be posted on this page
      with a new last-updated date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For questions about these terms, use the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page or email
      <a href="mailto:contact@accessfreetools.com">contact@accessfreetools.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
